WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.370
In December 2022,

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:07.550
the only road from Artsakh
to Armenia,

3
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.095
the Lachin corridor, was closed.

4
00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:12.714
Food, medicine and fuel ran short.

5
00:00:12.954 --> 00:00:16.744
In September 2023,
a final offensive

6
00:00:16.784 --> 00:00:19.200
forced the surrender of Artsakh.

7
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.930
Within about a week,

8
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:24.440
more than 100,000 people
had fled to Armenia.

9
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.848
Carry the people and their memory
out of the valley.

